      "≈"
     ]
    },
    ".\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "ip",
   "content": [
    "It can take a little bit of effort to decipher this message—to see who’s being spoken to—because it’s often alternating between Yahweh declaring good news to his people, and declaring bad news to Nineveh.\n"
   ]
